    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d922">

                <pb facs="0871" n="865" sameAs="frus:frus1939v04/pg865"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.6731/542: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ankara</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-04-01T16:00:00+02:00">April 1, 1939—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 1—12:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>27. Your No. 18, March 31, 6 p.m.<anchor n="22" xml:id="d922-f1"/></p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Trade agreement was signed at noon today. Publicity arrangements have been
                        made in accordance with your third paragraph. Textual details are given in
                        separate telegram.</item>
                    <pb facs="0872" n="866" xml:id="pg866"/>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>I take occasion to record warmest appreciation of patience and ability of
                        Kelley and Gillespie in bringing to a successful conclusion these
                        negotiations extending over almost a year.</item>
                </list>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>[For text of reciprocal trade agreement and supplementary notes, signed at
                        Ankara, April 1, 1939, see Department of State Executive Agreement Series
                        No. 163, or 54 Stat. 1870.]</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
